# Integration plan updates

When SSOI work changes the BibMon integration (wrapper contract, bundle,
training protocol, evaluation), update in the same cycle:

- BibMon `doc/SSOI_PLANO_VIVO.md` (canonical living plan: flowchart, API
  sketch, event-by-event logic, remaining work)
- this repo `doc/PLANO_INTEGRACAO_BIBMON.md` (phase status)

Do not commit industrial HDF5 or real bundles. Canonical spec remains
BibMon `doc/SSOI_BIBMON.md`.
